{
  "_howToUpdate": "Artifact Hub data. Expansions array is chronological (ARR > HW > SB > ShB > EW > DT); hub cards and tabs follow it. Each expansion has steps with perWeapon counts, sources (label+yields), vendors, reward stage, quest img + weapon stage imgs. collectAchievementIds maps JOB->achievement ID per step (null = manual-only until curated via ffxivcollect.com/achievements/types/4). Weapon stage imgs optional — modal falls back to stage names.",
  "_imageContract": "All images optional with graceful fallback. bannerImg: full-width hero per expansion (docs/data/artifacts/<exp>/banner.png). steps[].img: quest screenshot (step-<n>.png). weapons[].stages[] may be strings (name only) or {name,img} objects (weapon renders: <job>-<n>.png). Missing files never break layout — emoji/glyph placeholders render instead. glyph: fallback emoji shown on hub cards until banner art lands. Job icons: xivapi/classjob-icons (MIT), vendored under data/artifacts/jobs/<JOB>.png. Quest banners + item icons: consolegameswiki (CC BY-SA), vendored under data/artifacts/<exp>/quests/ and items/.",
  "_sourceFields": "sources[] entries support: label (required), yields (per run, required for run math), plus optional activity ('Vendor'|'FATE'|'Dungeon'|'Roulette'|'Raid'|'Deep Dungeon'|'Field Operation'), location (zone/coords), vendor (NPC names), cost (currency text), rate (drop-rate guesstimate, e.g. 'rare', '~10%'). The item modal renders whichever fields are present.",
